      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Microsoft Office consists of primary productivity components including MS Word, MS Excel, and MS PowerPoint.",
        "MS Word emphasizes word processing features and specific window components.",
        "MS Excel centers on essential spreadsheet terminology and common computational functions.",
        "MS PowerPoint focuses on presentation creation, slide features, and interface components.",
        "Basic keyboard shortcuts and important exam points are crucial elements for competitive exam preparation."
